input      | strtod       | before (upstream)      | after (this PR)
-----------|--------------|------------------------|------------------
1e+10      | 1e+10        | FAILED (ret untouched) | 1e+10 OK
1E+5       | 100000       | FAILED (ret untouched) | 100000 OK
6.02e+23   | 6.02e+23     | FAILED (ret untouched) | 6.02e+23 OK
-2.5e+3    | -2500        | FAILED (ret untouched) | -2500 OK
3.4e+38    | 3.4e+38      | FAILED (ret untouched) | 3.4e+38 OK
2.0E+8     | 2e+08        | FAILED (ret untouched) | 2e+08 OK
1e+0       | 1            | FAILED (ret untouched) | 1 OK
0.5e+2     | 50           | FAILED (ret untouched) | 50 OK
  fixed: 8/8   still broken: 0

Part 2 - no-regression sweep over 210 inputs containing no '+'
  behaviour changed on: 0  (must be 0)

